te/courses">Explore Courses</a><a class="w-full max-w-[180px] sm:w-auto text-center px-5 py-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg border border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 text-sm md:text-base hover:scale-105" href="https://neezamiyatesting.site/about">Learn More</a></div></div></div><div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 z-20 hidden lg:block" style="transform: translateY(7.15332px);"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-white/60"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider">Scroll</span><div class="w-0.5 h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 overflow-hidden" id="about" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img alt="Background" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" sizes="100vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fres.cloudinary.com%2Fdfp9qc0gu%2Fimage%2Fupload%2Fv1778304568%2Flms%2Fabout-section%2Fgwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="./ma_files/gwkijslujbej4uyxuk28.png" style="position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; color: transparent;"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/95 via-blue-50/95 to-white/95"></div></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-12"><div class="inline-block relative"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1E3A8A] mb-6 relative z-10" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);">Start Your HSE Career Today!</h2><div class="absolute -bottom-2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#B11217] to-transparent rounded-full"></div><div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-400 to-transparent rounded-full"></div></div><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-10" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed px-4">Learn IOSH, OSHA,BOSH, PTW, Fire Safety, First Aid and more with online classes, practical guidance, and job support.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-16"><div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-l-4 border-[#B11217] hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1E3A8A] mb-4 relative inline-block">Our Mission<span class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-16 h-1 bg-red-700 rounded-full"></span></h3><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">To equip young learners with industry-relevant technical skills through hands-on training, fostering innovation, safety, and professional ethics that prepare them for real-world challenges.</p></div><div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-r-4 border-[#1E3A8A] hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1E3A8A] mb-4 relative inline-block">Our Vision<span class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-16 h-1 bg-red-700 rounded-full"></span></h3><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">To become a globally recognized hub for technical education, creating a community of skilled professionals who prioritize safety, integrity, and continuous innovation.</p></div></div><div class="mb-16"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto" style=""><div class="mb-8 text-center"><h3 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 relative inline-block">Why Choose TechSafe Education?<span class="absolute -bottom-1 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-1 bg-red-700 rounded-full"></span></h3><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">We focus on quality, safety, and long-term value for students.</p></div><div class="space-y-3 mt-8"><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm hover:bg-white/90 transition-all duration-300"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left hover:bg-white transition-colors duration-200 group"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="flex-shrink-0 text-[#B11217] text-2xl transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0V0z"></path><path d="m10 17 5-5-5-5v10z"></path></svg><