entColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 5a3 3 0 015-2.236A3 3 0 0114.83 6H16a2 2 0 110 4h-5V9a1 1 0 10-2 0v1H4a2 2 0 110-4h1.17C5.06 5.687 5 5.35 5 5zm4 1V5a1 1 0 10-1 1h1zm3 0a1 1 0 10-1-1v1h1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path d="M9 11H3v5a2 2 0 002 2h4v-7zM11 18h4a2 2 0 002-2v-5h-6v7z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem]"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-2">It Best for learner students</p></div><div class="mb-4 p-3 bg-red-50 rounded-lg"><span class="text-xs text-gray-400 line-through">Rs&nbsp;170,000</span><div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#B11217]">Rs&nbsp;140,000</span></div><p class="text-xs text-green-600 mt-1">Save PKR 30,000</p></div><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto"><div class="flex gap-2"><button class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200 text-sm flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10 12a2 2 0 100-4 2 2 0 000 4z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M.458 10C1.732 5.943 5.522 3 10 3s8.268 2.943 9.542 7c-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7S1.732 14.057.458 10zM14 10a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>View Details</span></button><button class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-300 text-white text-sm flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer" style="background-color: rgb(177, 18, 23);"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a4 4 0 00-4 4v1H5a1 1 0 00-.994.89l-1 9A1 1 0 004 18h12a1 1 0 00.994-1.11l-1-9A1 1 0 0015 7h-1V6a4 4 0 00-4-4zm2 5V6a2 2 0 10-4 0v1h4zm-6 3a1 1 0 112 0 1 1 0 01-2 0zm7-1a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>Add to Bag</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative group" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 h-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 flex-shrink-0"><img alt="OSHA - General Industry 30 Hrs (IASP USA)" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" loading="lazy" src="./ma_files/y6b6mvlgeptkh0wni2y3.png"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10"><div class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm"><span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);">Safety Training</span></div></div></div><div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3 min-h-[3.5rem]"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0B1C3D] line-clamp-2 flex-1">OSHA - General Industry 30 Hrs (IASP USA)</h3><div class="p-2 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);"><path d="M9 4.804A7.968 7.968 0 005.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804v10A7.969 7.969 0 015.5 14c1.669 0 3.218.51 4.5 1.385A7.962 7.962 0 0114.5 14c1.255 0 2.443.29 3.5.804v-10A7.968 7.968 0 0014.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804V12a1 1 0 11-2 0V4.804z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem]"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-2">The 30-hour General Industry Safety and Health Program is intended to provide workers with some safety responsibility a greater depth and variety of training on an expanded list of topics associated with workplace hazards in general industry. The Program provides training for workers and employers on the recognition, avoidance, abatement, and prevention of safety and health hazards in their workplaces. The program also provides information regarding workers' rights, employer responsibilities, and how to file a complaint.

Important Information

This program has the same curriculum criteria for required, elective and optional topics and hours as the 30-Hour OSHA outreach training. Upon successful completion of this program, you will receive an OSHAcademy 30-hour General Industry Safety and Health certificate and card.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="truncate">3 Days</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg><span class="truncate">Beginner</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>Certificate</span></div></div><div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#B11217]">PKR 40,000</span></div></div></div><div class="flex gap-2"><a class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-center transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200 text-sm flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer" href="https://neezamiyatesting.site/courses/5e395e86-6427-48ec-82f1-518245860a20"><span>Details</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.293 3.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 010 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L14.586 11H3a1 1 0 110-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><button class="flex-1 py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-300 text-white text-sm flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer" style="background-color: rgb(177, 18, 23);"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a4 4 0 00-4 4v1H5a1 1 0 00-.994.89l-1 9A1 1 0 004 18h12a1 1 0 00.994-1.11l-1-9A1 1 0 0015 7h-1V6a4 4 0 00-4-4zm2 5V6a2 2 0 10-4 0v1h4zm-6 3a1 1 0 112 0 1 1 0 01-2 0zm7-1a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>Add to Bag</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative group" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 h-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 flex-shrink-0"><img alt="PTW (Permit to Work System) Uk &amp; USA" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" loading="lazy" src="./ma_files/lz0in35domeosjvjds0q.png"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10"><div class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm"><span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);">Safety Training</span></div></div></div><div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3 min-h-[3.5rem]"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0B1C3D] line-clamp-2 flex-1">PTW (Permit to Work System) Uk &amp; USA</h3><div class="p-2 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);"><path d="M9 4.804A7.968 7.968 0 005.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804v10A7.969 7.969 0 015.5 14c1.669 0 3.218.51 4.5 1.385A7.962 7.962 0 0114.5 14c1.255 0 2.443.29 3.5.804v-10A7.968 7.968 0 0014.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804V12a1 1 0 11-2 0V4.804z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem]"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-2">The Permit to Work (PTW) System course provides participants with the knowledge and skills to effectively implement and manage safe work permits for high-risk activities. It covers the purpose, types, and procedures of PTW, emphasizing hazard identification, risk assessment, roles and responsibilities, and compliance with safety regulations. By completing this course, learners will understand how to ensure workplace safety, prevent accidents, and maintain control over critical operations.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="truncate">1 Day</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg><span class="truncate">Beginner</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" v