l HAB is a smart safety and monitoring solution designed to enhance workplace protection by keeping a vigilant check on confined spaces and open areas. It ensures compliance with safety standards, reduces hazards, and helps maintain a secure environment for workers.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="truncate">1 Day</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg><span class="truncate">Beginner</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="ht