7h-1V6a4 4 0 00-4-4zm2 5V6a2 2 0 10-4 0v1h4zm-6 3a1 1 0 112 0 1 1 0 01-2 0zm7-1a1 1 0 100 2 1 1 0 000-2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>Add to Bag</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative group" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 h-full flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 flex-shrink-0"><img alt="Fire Safety (Uk &amp; USA)" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" loading="lazy" src="./ma_files/w6tskdvfmfvwnyuwsld6.png"><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10"><div class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm"><span class="text-xs font-medium" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);">Safety Training</span></div></div></div><div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-3 min-h-[3.5rem]"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0B1C3D] line-clamp-2 flex-1">Fire Safety (Uk &amp; USA)</h3><div class="p-2 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0 ml-2"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-5 h-5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="color: rgb(20, 184, 166);"><path d="M9 4.804A7.968 7.968 0 005.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804v10A7.969 7.969 0 015.5 14c1.669 0 3.218.51 4.5 1.385A7.962 7.962 0 0114.5 14c1.255 0 2.443.29 3.5.804v-10A7.968 7.968 0 0014.5 4c-1.255 0-2.443.29-3.5.804V12a1 1 0 11-2 0V4.804z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem]"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-2">This 6-hour Fire Safety course is designed to provide learners with essential knowledge and practical skills to prevent, identify, and respond to fire hazards in the workplace. Accredited by OSHAcademy USA, the program meets international safety standards and ensures participants are equipped to handle fire-related emergencies with confidence.

Through engaging content and real-world examples, learners will explore:

The science of fire and common workplace fire hazards

Fire prevention strategies and safe practices

Emergency response procedures and evacuation planning

Proper use of fire extinguishers and firefighting equipment

Roles and responsibilities in fire safety management

By the end of this course, participants will have a strong understanding of workplace fire safety requirements and be able to contribute to a safer environment for themselves and their colleagues. Successful candidates will receive an internationally recognized Fire Safety Certificate from OSHAcademy, USA.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm1-12a1 1 0 10-2 0v4a1 1 0 00.293.707l2.828 2.829a1 1 0 101.415-1.415L11 9.586V6z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span class="truncate">1 Day</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shrink-0" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838L7.667 9.088l1.94.831a1 1 0 00.787 0l7-3a1 1 0 000-1.838l-7-3zM3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zM9.3 16.573A9.026 9.026 0 007 14.935v-3.957l1.818.78a3 3 0 002.364 0l5.508-2.361a11.026 11.026 0 01.25 3.762 1 1 0 01-.89.89 8.968 8.968 0 00-5.35 2.524 1 1 0 01-1.4 0zM6 18a1 1 0 001-1v-2.065a8.935 8.935 0 00-2-.712V17a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg><span class="truncate">Beginner</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 bg-gray-50 p-2 rounded-lg min-h-[2.5rem]"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-[#1E3A8A] flex-shr