roup-hover:text-gray-800"> Courses</span></span><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-700 to-black transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full"></span><span class="absolute -bottom-1 left-0 w-full h-0.5 bg-gray-200"></span></h2><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-8" style=""><button class="
                px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm md:text-base font-semibold 
                transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer
